Machine-readable metadata is in `CITATION.cff`.
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  A machine-readable corpus of Marguerite Porete's Le Mirouer des simples âmes
  anienties (Middle French, Chantilly manuscript), with a documented
  speaker-extraction protocol and a reproducible analysis of the distribution
  of dialogue turns among its allegorical figures.
keywords:
  - digital humanities
  - computational philology
  - Middle French
  - Marguerite Porete
  - character networks
  - grammatical gender
